  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nValue 1 = 1 ÷ 20\n\nValue 2 = 11 ÷ 100\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nPercentage = (Part ÷ Whole) × 100\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (1 ÷ 20) ÷ (11 ÷ 100) × 100\n\n⇒ (1 ÷ 20) × (100 ÷ 11) × 100\n\n⇒ (100 ÷ 20 × 11) × 100\n\n⇒ (5 ÷ 11) × 100\n\n⇒ 500 ÷ 11\n\n⇒ 45.45\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 45.45%.**",
